  message: "Fixed in WIP PR. Haskell analyzer now parses module headers — _extract_module_exports returns set of names from header.exports children (variable for fns, name for types). Tri-state behavior: None (no list) = export-everything default per Haskell semantics; populated set = only listed names exported. Instances reachable through their class or type. 5 tests cover explicit list, no list, type names, classes, instances. dead-code-maybe's exports/tests seed sets are now functional on Haskell."  # 7f08
